   "hint": "Compare charge and number of mobile electrons.",
   "explain": "Mg has **2+ ions and twice the mobile electrons**, so a stronger bond."
  }
 ],
 "takeaways": [
  "Metallic bond: positive ions bound together by mobile electrons.",
  "Strength depends on the ion charge and the number of mobile electrons per atom.",
  "Free electrons explain electrical and thermal conduction."
